---
## Local development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Database (Docker Compose helpers)

```bash
npm run db:up    # start Postgres (and pgAdmin)
npm run db:logs  # follow logs
npm run db:down  # stop services
```

## After editing Prisma schema

```bash
npx prisma migrate dev --name <change>
npm run seed
```

## Build and run

```bash
npm run build
npm start
```

## Deploying (Vercel)

- Build command is defined in [vercel.json](mdc:vercel.json): `npm run migrate:deploy && next build`.
- Ensure env vars are set in Vercel: at least `DATABASE_URL` (and if auth is enabled later: `NEXTAUTH_URL`, `NEXTAUTH_SECRET`).
- Do not run local seeding in production.

